    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105">

                <pb facs="0218" n="112" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg112"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Brazil to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-11-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I thank you cordially for the kind words sent to me on behalf of President
                    Roosevelt, now traveling in the South. You are well acquainted with the friendly
                    feelings of the Government and people of Brazil toward the United States of
                    America.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Affonso Penna</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
